# The capture's denied prompt (docs/capture-plan.md §2 rule 1): the user
# answers the camera's prompt no, and a start that needs the camera fails
# `denied` while the microphone's own answer stands. Its own scene because a
# prompt is answered once per process.
expect label#1 "camera prompt, microphone prompt"
answer_permission camera denied
click button#1
expect label#1 "camera denied, microphone granted"
expect label#2 "failed denied"
expect_capture 0 "frames none, samples none"
expect_display_awake no
